{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>And Aaron and his sons did all the things that HaShem commanded by the hand of Moses.</b> In every other place it says \"as HaShem commanded by the hand of Moses,\" but here, because they added to the commandment, it does not say so — for they did not do exactly as HaShem commanded Moses, but rather they did all the things that HaShem commanded, and in addition there was added upon them what is said concerning strange fire: \"which He had not commanded them\" (Leviticus 10:1)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:51:52.655708078Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}